Greetings, <%= @display_login %>

Your <%= @discount_amount %> discount on <%= @product_name %> ends on <%= @expiration_date %>—that's in <%= @time_until_expiration %>.

<% if !@has_active_subscription -%>
You don't currently have an active <%= @product_name %> subscription, so nothing will be charged when this coupon expires.

<%= @settings_url %> - View Billing Settings
<% elsif @education_coupon -%>
After that, your subscription will be cancelled and you can resubscribe at any time.

<%= @settings_url %> - View Billing Settings
<% elsif @has_payment_or_invoiced -%>
After that, your subscription continues at <%= @regular_price_with_period %>—no action needed, your payment method is already on file.

<%= @settings_url %> - View Billing Settings
<% else -%>
Add a payment method to continue at <%= @regular_price_with_period %>, or your subscription will be cancelled.

<%= @settings_url %> - Add Payment Method
<% if @show_downgrade_option %>

Or downgrade to <%= branded_plan_name(GitHub::Plan.free) %>—you'll keep access to your private repos.
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

<% if @education_coupon %>
If you are still a student or teacher, you may apply for a new academic discount coupon at <%= link_to "https://education.github.com", "https://education.github.com" %>.
<% end %>

Questions? <%= contact_url %>

